est.com',NULL,'OFFER: PW_bulkuxreview Pending Sofa (CB2 1TN)','OFFER: PW_bulkuxreview Pending Sofa (CB2 1TN)','Offer','1783591287852134163021@pw-testenv-7','','Test with 2 attachments\n\nAnd a line break.\n\nAt the beginning of August every year we hold a 3-day craft fair in St. Andrewâ€™s Church, Penrith. The 2018 fair\nwill be the 7th. As well as local crafts we sell good quality second-hand books and bric-a-brac. All the\nproceed from the sale of these, plus proceeds from refreshments, raffles and competitions â€“ as well as a percentage of the craft sales - is divided between St. Andrewâ€™s Church and a local charity. Last year, thanks to your generosity, we were able to donate over 6,000, and we want to beat last year\'s total!  This year we are supporting the Alzheimerâ€™s Society.  This illness affects so many peopleâ€™s lives.  Please help us to raise as much as we can.\nIf you can donate any good books or bric-a-brac, please let us know. We are happy to collect locally.  Thank you.',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,52.205300,0.121800,1687415,NULL,NULL,1,1,'Pending',0,NULL,'Pending',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-09 10:01:27',NULL);
