d between St. Andrewâ€™s Church and a local charity. Last year, thanks to your generosity, we were able to donate over 6,000, and we want to beat last year\'s total!  This year we are supporting the Alzheimerâ€™s Society.  This illness affects so many peopleâ€™s lives.  Please help us to raise as much as we can.\nIf you can donate any good books or bric-a-brac, please let us know. We are happy to collect locally.  Thank you.\n\n\n--------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\n\n<HTML><HEAD>\n<STYLE id=3DeMClientCss>\nblockquote.cite { margin-left: 5px; margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 10px;=\n padding-right:0px; border-left: 1px solid #cccccc }\nblockquote.cite2 {margin-left: 5px; margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 10px;=\n padding-right:0px; border-left: 1px solid #cccccc; margin-top: 3px; paddin=\ng-top: 0px; }\n.plain pre, .plain tt { font-family: monospace; font-size: 100%; font-weigh=\nt: normal; font-style: normal; white-space: pre-wrap; }\na img { border: 0px; }body {font-family: Tahoma;font-size: 12pt;}\n.plain pre, .plain tt {font-family: Tahoma;font-size: 12pt;}</STYLE>\n</HEAD>\n<BODY>Test with 2 attachments</BODY></HTML>\n--------=_MB153ECA7E-06F3-462A-AF2C-D3E3B2A46538--\n\n--------=_MBBD231414-99C8-4563-B61D-69E50BE6FCD3\nContent-Type: image/png; name=g4g220x194.png\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: base64\nContent-Disposition: attachment; filename=g4g220x194.png\n\niVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAANwAAADCCAYAAAAihqxqAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAAZiS0dEAP8A\n/wD/oL2nkwAAAAlwSFlzAAAuIwAALiMBeKU/dgAAAAd0SU1FB90HFg8sOyZAtLUAAB6nSURBVHja\n7Z15mB1FtcB/NZNMMtnIAiSQsBjWsAmGVWYMEAMIyKYPnyC4oegTEdwFNTOigA9E4PlEn4DgAgrC\nQxAeO4SMkR0hEIEQDDATIgSykMlk1np/1Gmmpqe679b3zsL5fV9/M3frrq6uU3XOqVOnQFEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEU\nRVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEURVEGP/MXTk/8rKFpxoCVy